### Day 02: REST Principles & Dynamic Queries - Interactive REST Client
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Create Product 1 (POST 201 Created + Location)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "SKU-KEY-0001",
  "name": "Mechanical Keyboard",
  "description": "RGB tactile switches for gaming",
  "price": 149.99,
  "stockQuantity": 25,
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}

### 2. Create Product 2 (POST 201 Created + Location)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "SKU-MOU-0002",
  "name": "Wireless Ergonomic Mouse",
  "description": "Precision productivity mouse",
  "price": 69.99,
  "stockQuantity": 0,
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}

### 3. Create Product 3 (Draft Status)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "SKU-PAD-0003",
  "name": "Desk Mat Pad",
  "description": "Extra large water-resistant desk mat",
  "price": 29.99,
  "stockQuantity": 50,
  "status": "DRAFT"
}

### 4. Complete Replacement (PUT 200 OK)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "SKU-KEY-0001",
  "name": "Mechanical Gaming Keyboard Pro",
  "description": "Upgraded hot-swappable tactile switches",
  "price": 169.99,
  "stockQuantity": 30,
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}

### 5. Partial Modification (PATCH 200 OK)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 159.99,
  "stockQuantity": 45
}

### 6. Paginated & Sorted Query (GET 200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products?page=0&size=2&sort=price,desc
Accept: application/json

### 7. Dynamic Search & Filters (GET 200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products?search=keyboard&minPrice=100&maxPrice=200&status=ACTIVE&inStock=true
Accept: application/json

### 8. Resource Removal (DELETE 204 No Content)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products/3
